<title>USA: IMM currencies end mixed, marks close near lows.</title>
<headline>IMM currencies end mixed, marks close near lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>Oct 2 - IMM currency futures ended mixed. Marks and Swiss francs closed near the daily lows after comments by N.Y. Fed chairman Whitehead. Whitehead said he sees further gains in dollar vs European currencies. Fund selling in marks pushed Dec Swiss francs below the three-mos low of $0.8010. Can dollars firmed into close.</p>
